       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. WITHDRAW.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BALANCE PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 100.00.
       01 REQUEST-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 150.00.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF REQUEST-AMOUNT > BALANCE
               DISPLAY "DECLINED"
           ELSE
               COMPUTE BALANCE = BALANCE - REQUEST-AMOUNT
           END-IF
           STOP RUN.
